{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-bull-and-cygnus-fire-alarm-detection-system-fads-2607-0120","content_id":"f3788606-aeae-462f-b1d1-be782fca3b19","description":"Product Recall for Bull and Cygnus Fire Alarm Detection Systems.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"738bffe2-b6e7-4ad5-aad7-0dda89481c47","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-08-12T12:21:01+01:00","id":"738bffe2-b6e7-4ad5-aad7-0dda89481c47","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-08-12T12:21:01+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7c571d347b198efd290f55/2607-0120-product-recall-wireless-fire-alarm-systems.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Bull and Cygnus Fire Alarm Detection System (FADS)</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: During a loss of communication in the system, there may be delayed fire detection and alarm activation in the case of a fire, increasing the risk of injury or loss of life.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: Affected products have been withdrawn from the market, and Bull Products and Cygnus Group have commenced a replacement programme to replace all affected units.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Home Safety/Fire Prevention – Public Fire Alarms</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>‘Bull’ and ‘Cygnus’</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Batch Reference</td>\n      <td>NCU serial numbers ranging from XAB.2410.01.0001/17518/06.00 to XAB.2410.01.0528/17518/06.00</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>United Kingdom</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Affected products are wireless FADS manufactured by Bull Products and Cygnus Group, incorporating network control units (NCUs) which manage communication between the devices in the system and the Control and indicating equipment (CIE). The issue is confined to a single batch of NCUs with serial numbers ranging from XAB.2410.01.0001/17518/06.00 to XAB.2410.01.0528/17518/06.00.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_738bffe2-b6e7-4ad5-aad7-0dda89481c47\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7c571d347b198efd290f55/2607-0120-product-recall-wireless-fire-alarm-systems.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"affected-models\">Affected Models</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Model Number</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Description</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Serial Number Pre-Fix</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">YYMM Range containing all affected 2410 batch*</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Company</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Brand</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Marking</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>SN.CIE20.A</td>\n      <td>SmartNet Pro Control Panel, 64 zone, 868 MHz – with zone LEDs</td>\n      <td>CSC</td>\n      <td>2506 - 2604</td>\n      <td>Cygnus</td>\n      <td>SmartNet Pro</td>\n      <td>UKCA/CE</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>SN.CIE30.A</td>\n      <td>SmartNet Pro Control Panel, 96 zone, 868 MHz – with zone LEDs</td>\n      <td>CSD</td>\n      <td>2503 - 2603</td>\n      <td>Cygnus</td>\n      <td>SmartNet Pro</td>\n      <td>UKCA/CE</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>S1.CIE10.A</td>\n      <td>SmartNet 100 Control Panel, 32 zone, 868 MHz – with zone LEDs</td>\n      <td>C1B</td>\n      <td>2506 - 2604</td>\n      <td>Cygnus</td>\n      <td>SmartNet 100</td>\n      <td>UKCA/CE</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>CN.CIE10.2</td>\n      <td>SiteNet Control Panel, 32 zone, 868 MHz – with zone LEDs</td>\n      <td>CCB</td>\n      <td>2507 - 2601</td>\n      <td>Bull</td>\n      <td>SiteNet</td>\n      <td>UKCA/CE</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>CN.CIE00.2</td>\n      <td>SiteNet Control Panel, 16 zone, 868 MHz – with zone LEDs</td>\n      <td>CCA</td>\n      <td>2507 - 2604</td>\n      <td>Bull</td>\n      <td>SiteNet</td>\n      <td>UKCA/CE</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>A manufacturing defect in the network control unit (NCU) may cause a loss of communication between devices within the fire alarm system and the control and indicating equipment (CIE).</p>\n\n<p>During an outage, the system may fail to process or respond to alarm inputs. This could result in delayed fire detection or alarm activation, increasing the risk of injury or loss of life in the event of a fire.</p>\n\n<p>Affected products do not meet the requirements of Regulation 305/2011 as it applies in GB.</p>\n\n<p>The defect is confined to a single batch of NCUs (batch reference 2410). Not all units in the batch are affected. Any loss of communication is indicated on the fire alarm panel via visual and audible fault indicators, meaning an outage is readily identifiable. The majority of outages are of short duration and self-correcting without user intervention.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>Affected products have been withdrawn from the market. All remaining stock from the affected batch has been quarantined. Bull Products and Cygnus Group have commenced a phased replacement programme to replace all affected NCUs, including units that have not exhibited failures.\nAffected customers who have purchased this product have been contacted by Bull Products and Cygnus Group with further information.</p>\n\n<p>Responsible persons, fire risk assessors and building managers are advised to consider, based on the information provided, whether any temporary measures are necessary while remediation is completed.</p>\n\n<p>Enhanced end-of-line testing has been introduced and all future production utilises a redesigned NCU board to prevent recurrence.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2607-0120</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-12T09:56:56Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"headers":[{"id":"affected-models","level":3,"text":"Affected Models"}],"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"construction-products","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-08-12","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-08-12T10:56:56+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-bull-and-cygnus-fire-alarm-detection-system-fads-2607-0120","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-bull-and-cygnus-fire-alarm-detection-system-fads-2607-0120","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-bull-and-cygnus-fire-alarm-detection-system-fads-2607-0120","content_id":"f3788606-aeae-462f-b1d1-be782fca3b19","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-12T09:56:56Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Bull and Cygnus Fire Alarm Detection System (FADS) (2607-0120)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-bull-and-cygnus-fire-alarm-detection-system-fads-2607-0120","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"